{{Quote|Salutations! Salutations! I am unarmed but for this tablet bearing the terms of surrender. I wish to present it to whomever spokesperson is empowered to deliberate an acceptable outcome in the eyes of the Oba Diah high council.|A Twi'lek majordomo, to members of the Pyke Syndicate|<ref name="Chapter 7" />}}
The '''Oba Diah high council''' was a body that was a part of the [[Pyke Syndicate]]. When [[Daimyo]] [[Boba Fett]] sent a [[Mok Shaiz's majordomo|Twi'lek majordomo]] to negotiate with the Syndicate, the [[majordomo]] asked to present the terms of surrender to a spokesperson that was empowered to deliberate an acceptable outcome in the eyes of the [[Oba Diah]] high council.<ref name="Chapter 7" />

